oke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-4 w-4 text-blue-700\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg>Islamic Name Guides</div><h2 class=\"nv-display mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl\">Continue your name research</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base\">More expert NameVerse guides to help you compare meanings, origins and naming decisions.</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700\" href=\"/blog\">View all guides<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><article class=\"group overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-xl \"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br h-56\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 18% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 0 10%, transparent 11%), linear-gradient(135deg, #DBEAFE, #BFDBFE)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-30\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15,23,42,0.12) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(15,23,42,0.10) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:32px 32px\"></div><div class=\"absolute -right-8 -bottom-10 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-white/30 blur-2xl\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-full items-cente